The website that I built is with plain HTML and CSS , as I am a beginner, It is a very basic Website.
Started with index.html, which is basically the homepage. At the top, there’s a navigation bar where you can jump between Home, About, Projects, and Contact.
The Home section gives you a quick intro what I am doing at the present. About shows a little deeper into my Education and what skills I have at this point . 
In projects  I’ve showcased 2 of my basic HTML projects. And Contact That’s where I've added my contact details so that if you want to reach out , you can.
For the layout, I’ve created a separate CSS file called port.css that handles all the styling. All in all, the setup keeps things neat, simple, and easy for anyone who visits.

